---
// The Conference, rewritten 2026-11-22 per the website update brief (the logistics section was then removed
// the same day at the project lead's request): what the conference is, how to take
// part before it, the logistics status (Qingdao named once, no unconfirmed month, attendance estimate or
// committee deadline), and the series history moved here from About and Resources.
// Copy: [brief] the website update brief, which cites dco-oo.org/events for the Glasgow town hall and the
// OceanObs’19 editorial (Frontiers in Marine Science, 2019, doi:10.3389/fmars.2019.00570) for the series.
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';

import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '~/components/site/PageHeader.astro';
import { getPermalink } from '~/utils/permalinks';

const metadata = {
  title: 'The Conference',
  description: 'About the OceanObs’29 conference, its planning status, and ways to contribute before the meeting.',
};

const linkClass = 'font-semibold text-link underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline';
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="The Conference"
    title="The OceanObs’29 conference"
    intro="OceanObs’29 brings together people who collect, share, and use ocean observations to identify gaps and set priorities for the next decade of observing."
  />

  <!-- Taking part before the conference [brief] -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="before">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-6">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <p class="eyebrow-bar text-muted">Before the conference</p>
        <h2 id="before" class="mt-3 scroll-mt-28 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-heading md:text-4xl">
          Taking part before the conference
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="text-lg text-default">
          You can help shape the agenda before the conference, even if you cannot travel. At the 2026 Ocean Sciences
          Meeting town hall in Glasgow, participants discussed observing priorities and gaps. See <a
            class={linkClass}
            href={`${getPermalink('/events')}#upcoming`}>News &amp; Events</a
          > for announced opportunities at other meetings, or <a
            class={linkClass}
            href={`${getPermalink('/get-involved')}#ways`}>share a priority in writing</a
          > with the Coordination Team. Tell us what needs to be measured, where coverage is missing, and who would use the
          information.
        </p>
        <!-- Add regional dialogues or virtual sessions here once a host, date and public participation route are confirmed. -->
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href={getPermalink('/get-involved')} class="btn-site-primary">
            Get involved <Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true" />
          </a>
          <a href={`${getPermalink('/events')}#upcoming`} class="btn-site-outline">
            News &amp; Events <Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The series, moved from About and Resources [brief] -->
  <section class="bg-mist py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="series">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-6">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <p class="eyebrow-bar text-muted">Since 1999</p>
        <h2 id="series" class="mt-3 scroll-mt-28 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-heading md:text-4xl">
          The OceanObs conference series
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="text-lg text-default">
          Since 1999, OceanObs conferences have brought the observing community together to set priorities. OceanObs’19
          broadened the discussion across physical, biogeochemical, and biological observations and drew on community
          white papers to identify what the observing system needed next.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3">
          <li>
            <a
              href={`${getPermalink('/resources')}#archives`}
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-link underline-offset-4 hover:underline"
            >
              OceanObs’19 papers, synthesis, and statement <Icon
                name="tabler:arrow-right"
                class="h-4 w-4"
                aria-hidden="true"
              />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://oceanobs.org/"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-link underline-offset-4 hover:underline"
            >
              OceanObs conference archive <Icon name="tabler:arrow-up-right" class="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true" />
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
